    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just that there is no \"new strategy\" for this. the numbers don't change, the debt doesn't go away, and the exhaustion stays the same. i look at my life and i don't see a future, i just see a long, slow decline until there's nothing left. it feels like a trap. like i'm just scheduled to suffer for the next forty years and there's no exit strategy. it feels like the only way to actually stop the noise is to just... stop everything.",
